text":"그림 10.9 페이지 교체의 필요성","words":[{"text":"그림","x":745,"y":1088,"width":48,"height":27},{"text":"10.9","x":805,"y":1090,"width":55,"height":23},{"text":"페이지","x":889,"y":1088,"width":72,"height":28},{"text":"교체의","x":971,"y":1088,"width":71,"height":28},{"text":"필요성","x":1052,"y":1088,"width":70,"height":28}]},{"text":"system) 양쪽이 전제 메모리를 대상으로 할당 경쟁을 벌이도록 하기도 한다. 14.6절에","words":[{"text":"system)","x":288,"y":1227,"width":136,"height":35},{"text":"양쪽이","x":442,"y":1225,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"전제","x":560,"y":1226,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"메모리를","x":638,"y":1227,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"대상으로","x":780,"y":1227,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"할당","x":917,"y":1228,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"경쟁을","x":994,"y":1227,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"벌이도록","x":1097,"y":1227,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"하기도","x":1230,"y":1228,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":1335,"y":1228,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"14.6절에","x":1421,"y":1228,"width":129,"height":36}]},{"text":"서는 I/O 버퍼와 가상 메모리 기법 간의 통합적 관계에 관해 설명한다.","words":[{"text":"서는","x":290,"y":1280,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"I/O","x":371,"y":1285,"width":68,"height":32},{"text":"버퍼와","x":454,"y":1284,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"가상","x":566,"y":1285,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"메모리","x":644,"y":1286,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"기법","x":752,"y":1285,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"간의","x":826,"y":1286,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"통합적","x":898,"y":1286,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"관계에","x":1001,"y":1286,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"관해","x":1104,"y":1286,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"설명한다.","x":1176,"y":1288,"width":128,"height":35}]},{"text":"메모리의 초과 할당은 다음과 같이 나타난다. 프로세스가 실행되는 동안 페이지 폴","words":[{"text":"메모리의","x":355,"y":1341,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"초과","x":507,"y":1343,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"할당은","x":588,"y":1344,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"다음과","x":700,"y":1344,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"같이","x":810,"y":1344,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"나타난다.","x":886,"y":1345,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1030,"y":1345,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"실행되는","x":1198,"y":1347,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"동안","x":1333,"y":1348,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"페이지","x":1411,"y":1348,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"폴","x":1520,"y":1350,"width":34,"height":33}]},{"text":"트가 발생한다. 운영체제는 필요로 하는 페이지가 보조저장장지에 저장된 위치를 알아","words":[{"text":"트가","x":291,"y":1400,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"발생한다.","x":376,"y":1401,"width":143,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제는","x":537,"y":1401,"width":164,"height":35},{"text":"필요로","x":718,"y":1403,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"하는","x":827,"y":1403,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"페이지가","x":905,"y":1404,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"보조저장장지에","x":1041,"y":1405,"width":212,"height":37},{"text":"저장된","x":1272,"y":1407,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"위치를","x":1378,"y":1408,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"알아","x":1489,"y":1408,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"내지만 가용한 프레임 목록에 가용한 프레임이 없음을 발견한다. 즉, 모든 메모리가","words":[{"text":"내지만","x":292,"y":1458,"width":103,"height":35},{"text":"가용한","x":408,"y":1460,"width":102,"height":35},{"text":"프레임","x":521,"y":1460,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"목록에","x":630,"y":1461,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"가용한","x":741,"y":1461,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"프레임이","x":847,"y":1463,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"없음을","x":986,"y":1464,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"발견한다.","x":1085,"y":1464,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"즉,","x":1226,"y":1468,"width":38,"height":33},{"text":"모든","x":1277,"y":1469,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"메모리가","x":1350,"y":1467,"width":129,"height":35}]},{"text":"중이다. 이 상황은 그림 10.9에 도시되어 있으며 가용한 프레임이 없다는 사실은 물음표","words":[{"text":"중이다.","x":291,"y":1518,"width":111,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":420,"y":1519,"width":28,"height":35},{"text":"상황은","x":465,"y":1519,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"그림","x":578,"y":1520,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"10.9에","x":656,"y":1521,"wid